TITLE Kinetic dissolution of Calcite in hydrothermal solution at 100C

SOLUTION 1
    temp      100
    pH        5
    pe        4
    units     mmol/kgw
    C(4)      0.5
    Mn        1.0

KINETICS 1
Calcite
    -tol    1e-8
    -m0     1.0
    -m      1.0
    -parms  10.0   0.001
    -time   1000 in 100

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file   calcite_kinetic.sel
    -reset  false
    -step   true
    -time   true
    -pe     true
    -pH     true

END
